# =============================================================================
# FluxBus — estrutura de pastas no VPS (198.7.116.227)
# =============================================================================
# Coolify: http://198.7.116.227:8000
# IPv6:    http://[2a02:c202:2196:8228::1]:8000
#
# Criar pastas: bash deploy/scripts/setup-server-dirs.sh
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mapa ambiente → pasta no servidor
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# | Ambiente | Pasta raiz              | Frontend              | API                    |
# |----------|-------------------------|-----------------------|------------------------|
# | PROD     | /var/www/fluxbus        | www.fluxbus.com.br    | api.fluxbus.com.br     |
# | DEV      | /var/www/fluxbus/dev    | dev.fluxbus.com.br    | api.dev.fluxbus.com.br |
# | CI       | /ci                     | ci.fluxbus.com.br     | api.ci.fluxbus.com.br  |
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Árvore de diretórios
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# /var/www/fluxbus/                    ← PROD
# ├── app/                             clone Git (debug manual, opcional)
# ├── data/
# │   ├── uploads/                     volume backend → /app/uploads
# │   ├── holerites/                   volume backend → /app/holerites
# │   ├── logs/                        volume backend → /app/logs
# │   ├── backups/                     dumps PostgreSQL
# │   └── whatsapp-sessions/           volume whatsapp → /app/sessions
# └── dev/                             ← DEV
#     ├── app/
#     └── data/
#         ├── uploads/
#         ├── holerites/
#         ├── logs/
#         ├── backups/
#         └── whatsapp-sessions/
#
# /ci/                                 ← CI
# ├── app/
# └── data/
#     ├── uploads/
#     ├── holerites/
#     ├── logs/
#     ├── backups/
#     └── whatsapp-sessions/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Volumes no Coolify (Persistent Storage → host path)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# PROD backend:
#   /var/www/fluxbus/data/uploads      → /app/uploads
#   /var/www/fluxbus/data/holerites    → /app/holerites
#   /var/www/fluxbus/data/logs         → /app/logs
#
# DEV backend:
#   /var/www/fluxbus/dev/data/uploads      → /app/uploads
#   /var/www/fluxbus/dev/data/holerites    → /app/holerites
#   /var/www/fluxbus/dev/data/logs         → /app/logs
#
# CI backend:
#   /ci/data/uploads      → /app/uploads
#   /ci/data/holerites    → /app/holerites
#   /ci/data/logs         → /app/logs
#
# WhatsApp (por ambiente):
#   .../data/whatsapp-sessions → /app/sessions

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Arquivos de configuração no repositório
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PROD: deploy/fluxbus/prod/coolify.frontend.example
#       deploy/fluxbus/prod/coolify.backend.example
# DEV:  deploy/fluxbus/dev/coolify.frontend.example
#       deploy/fluxbus/dev/coolify.backend.example
# CI:   deploy/ci/coolify.frontend.example
#       deploy/ci/coolify.backend.example
